### POST login - Set name in thread-local context
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

John Doe


### GET whoami - Get name from thread-local context
GET http://localhost:8080/whoami

### POST scoped login - Set name in scoped thread-local context
POST http://localhost:8080/scoped/login
Content-Type: application/json

Jane Smith

### GET scoped whoami - Get name from scoped thread-local context
GET http://localhost:8080/scoped/whoami

### GET scopedValue - Test scoped value with Authorization header
GET http://localhost:8080/scopedValue
Authorization: Bearer sample-token-123

### GET scopedValue - Test scoped value without Authorization header
GET http://localhost:8080/scopedValue

### GET run - Test structured concurrency with scoped values
GET http://localhost:8080/run
